.Dd October 6, 2026
.Dt FRAMEWORK_KEYBOARD 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm framework-keyboard
.Nd Framework Laptop session glue for FreeBSD X11
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is the meta package for a Framework Laptop session.
The Fn and media keys are ordinary laptop keys and ship as separate
bhotkeys packages:
.Pp
.Bl -tag -width "bhotkeys-brightness" -compact
.It Sy bhotkeys-airplane
airplane mode
.Pq Super+A and the radio key
.It Sy bhotkeys-audio
volume, mute, and which output plays
.It Sy bhotkeys-brightness
backlight up and down
.It Sy bhotkeys-media
play/pause, rewind, and fast forward
.It Sy bhotkeys-mirror
mirror the internal panel
.It Sy bhotkeys-screenshot
PrintScreen for the desktop, the focused window, and the greeter
.El
.Pp
Other chords stay in their own packages:
.Sy bhotkeys-extend ,
.Sy bhotkeys-lid-state ,
.Sy bhotkeys-lock ,
.Sy bhotkeys-albert ,
and
.Sy framework-autorotate-hotkey
.Pq Framework Laptop 12 .
Super+/ is bhotkeys itself.
.Pp
.Xr bhotkeys-start 1
starts one
.Xr bosd 1
and one bhotkeys listener.
.Xr bhotkeys 1
ships the autostart entry and the i3 config that run it.
.Xr bhotkeys-greeter 1
starts the greeter listener and stops it before the user
session.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr bhotkeys 1 ,
.Xr bhotkeys-greeter 1 ,
.Xr bhotkeys-start 1 ,
.Xr bosd 1 ,
.Xr framework_autorotate 8 ,
.Xr hrfkill 4 ,
.Xr backlight 8 ,
.Xr pulseaudio 1 ,
.Xr xlock 1
.Sh AUTHORS
.An Devin Teske Aq Mt dteske@FreeBSD.org
